   "description": "Strict reader and writer of the CCSDS 301.0-B-4 ASCII time codes A (calendar) and B (day of year), with the fraction kept as its digits; fields equal to CPython datetime and numpy.datetime64 on 600 instants and to astropy on the 331 between 1900 and 2100; refuses all 40 malformed or out-of-range texts of the corpus, of which the ISO parsers of those libraries accept 10 to 14.",
